# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use matrix multiplication to verify that the steps in the QFT algorithm "
"indeed result in the $\\text{QFT}_4$ matrix:\n"
msgstr "行列の掛け算を使って、QFT アルゴリズムの各ステップが確かに $\\text{QFT}_4$ 行列になることを検証してください。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{QFT}_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"    1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & i & -1 & -i \\\\\n"
"    1 & -1 & 1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & -i & -1 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{QFT}_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"    1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & i & -1 & -i \\\\\n"
"    1 & -1 & 1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & -i & -1 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

